// L6: a list literal whose element type is a mixed-width numeric literal union, keyed by its
// member sequence `i64|i32|i64`. The value is the literal itself, so the un-annotated face
// infers the element type.
//
// Format: scripts/capability-probes/README.md, "Template format".
// @@VALUE@@
[9000000000, 1, 9000000001]
// @@TYPE@@
(9000000000 | 1 | 9000000001)[]
